<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<button type="button" class="secondary" popovertarget="pass-refund" aria-haspopup="dialog">환불하기</button>
<section id="pass-refund" class="pass-cover-popover" popover role="dialog" aria-labelledby="pass-refund-title"><div class="pass-cover-popover-heading"><h2 id="pass-refund-title">투어패스 환불</h2><button type="button" class="secondary" popovertarget="pass-refund" popovertargetaction="hide" autofocus>닫기</button></div><p><strong><c:out value="${refundPass.productName}"/></strong> <fmt:formatNumber value="${refundPass.priceWon}"/>원을 환불하고 이 투어패스를 취소해요. 환불하면 코드를 쓸 수 없고 되돌릴 수 없어요. 시연 결제라 실제로 돌려받는 금액은 없어요.</p><form method="post" action="${root}/passes/refund"><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/shared/csrf.jspf" %><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${refundPass.id}"><button>환불하기</button></form></section>
